svg.desc:
Base frames: f01 left panel (a) video feature division and two-layer recurrent propagation over sequence;
f02 top middle panel (b) layer-I propagation with K preceding features and RP-I;
f03 top right panel (c) layer-II propagation with 2K preceding modulated features and RP-II;
f04 middle right panel (d) MFCA/CMF guided alignment and fusion flow;
f05 bottom right legend. All objects are native SVG with stable IDs.
